<title>PHILIPPINES: DMCI, John Laing unit sign pact.</title>
<headline>DMCI, John Laing unit sign pact.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>DMCI Holdings Inc has entered into an agreement with a unit of John Laing Plc to form a consortium that will vie for a tollway project in the Philippines.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the stock exchange released on Friday, DMCI said the consortium to be set up with John Laing International Ltd is willing to undertake the construction of the Laguna de Bay Tollway project on the northern island of Luzon. -- Manila newsroom (63 2) 8418939 Fax 8176267</p>
